<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>
This table shows the probing accuracy (%) using the <span id="A3.T2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">last layer’s representation</span>. We run all the evaluation 5 times and report the average results. <span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A3.T2.m126.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_markedasmath" height="13.84" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-2.08px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 27.75 13.84" width="27.75"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,13.84) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.15 L 0 9.69 C 0 11.98 1.86 13.84 4.15 13.84 L 23.6 13.84 C 25.89 13.84 27.75 11.98 27.75 9.69 L 27.75 4.15 C 27.75 1.86 25.89 0 23.6 0 L 4.15 0 C 1.86 0 0 1.86 0 4.15 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFE6E6;" fill="#FFE6E6" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.15 L 0 9.69 C 0 11.98 1.86 13.84 4.15 13.84 L 23.6 13.84 C 25.89 13.84 27.75 11.98 27.75 9.69 L 27.75 4.15 C 27.75 1.86 25.89 0 23.6 0 L 4.15 0 C 1.86 0 0 1.86 0 4.15 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 1.38 2.08)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1.31em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="18.07"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A3.T2.m126.pic1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">(<math id="A3.T2.m126.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math>x)</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span> is the accuracy difference between the probe trained on the last layer and on the <span id="A3.T2.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">peak layer</span>. The best results are <span id="A3.T2.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bolded</span>.
</figcaption>
</figure>
